    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad#PL59.AD.16.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.16.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nudus, inquit Job, exivi de utero matris meæ, nudus revertar in terram (Job I, 21).",
    "chunk_index": 50,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad#PL59.AD.16.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.16.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Patet quam infidclis sit usus divitiarum, qui nos nec in principio nostro, nec in fine comitatur. Quid aurum et argentum avare multiplicas?",
    "chunk_index": 51,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad#PL59.AD.16.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.16.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "quid luum dicis, ad quod nudus venisti? Mundi est facultas quam tuam , communis est quam propriam putas.",
    "chunk_index": 52,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad#PL59.AD.16.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.16.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Via itineris cujuscunque quam gra­ dimur, breviter dici nostra potest, dum a nobis am­ bulatur : nobis vero praetergressis, illorum est qui sequuntur.",
    "chunk_index": 53,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad#PL59.AD.16.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.16.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quomodo potest nostra esse facultas ca­ duca atque terrena, si non pascat egenum, cuM possit pascere violentum ?",
    "chunk_index": 54,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad#PL59.AD.16.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.16.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quomodo nostrum cst, in quo nec capiendo innoxii, nec continendo justi , nec pos­ sidendo certi, nec conservando securi sumus?",
    "chunk_index": 55,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad#PL59.AD.16.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.16.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et quam pro certo tenemus , nos nudos in terram ve­ nisse, tam certo sciamus, de terrestribus nos auferre nihil posse.",
    "chunk_index": 56,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad#PL59.AD.16.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.16.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Apostolus se recolit nihil intulisse, nihil ablaturum esse. Job fatetur nudum se natum, nu­ dumque moriturum.",
    "chunk_index": 57,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad#PL59.AD.16.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.16.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Salomon omnibus parem clamat interitum et similem exitum. Quantumlibet ambi­ tione velit quisque discerni, principio et fine conjun­ gitur.",
    "chunk_index": 58,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad#PL59.AD.16.s13",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.16.s13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nam quod dixit, Unus introitus omnibus ad vi­ tam, et par egressus ad mortem (Sap.",
    "chunk_index": 59,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad#PL59.AD.16.s14",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.16.s14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "VII, 6), non incritorum æqualitatem, sed æqualem docuit condi­ lionem.",
    "chunk_index": 60,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad#PL59.AD.16.s15",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.16.s15",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Unde si apparet, ut opinor, nec infida fide­ lium , nec peritura esse salvorum, quæ sint nostra paululum discernamus.",
    "chunk_index": 61,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad#PL59.AD.16.s16",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.16.s16",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ecce, ut supra dixi, cum in hunc mundum veniente, nihil terrenae facultatis in. ferimus, animam tamen arbitrii compotem capacem­ que rationis, ad eligendum bonum, si Deus inspira­ verit, exhibemus.",
    "chunk_index": 62,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad#PL59.AD.16.s17",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.16.s17",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Cumque processu temporis volun­ tatis nostrae qualitas confirmatur, Dei voluntas est ut bene faciamus, sed nostium est quod fecerimus.",
    "chunk_index": 63,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad#PL59.AD.16.s18",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.16.s18",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "An forte dicit aliquis , et hanc ipsam boni actionem potest homo insidiante diabolo perdere. Verum est, quod amittere homo bonum proprium furante adver- sario potest.",
    "chunk_index": 64,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad#PL59.AD.16.s19",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.16.s19",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sed hinc magis nostrum conjici debet, quia non violenter aufertur. Non enim taliter perdi­ mus mercedem, qualiler facultatem.",
    "chunk_index": 65,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad#PL59.AD.16.s20",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.16.s20",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quod enim ex­ tra nos est, carnalis inimicus rapiendo auferre po­ test : quod vero intra nos, non potest spiritualis nisi insidiando furari.",
    "chunk_index": 66,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad#PL59.AD.16.s21",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_17_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.16.s21",
